<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cereals office ONIC's monthly soft wheat estimates (July/June, million tonnes).</p>
<p>			96/97(Apr)  96/97(Mar)	     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 2.212	 2.212		3.087</p>
<p> Harvested crop	34.657	34.578	     29.825</p>
<p> Delivered crop	30.450	30.420	     25.955</p>
<p> Non-farm use	  12.779	12.779	     12.367</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  9.185	 9.135		8.613</p>
<p> Export to non-EU     6.400	 6.400		3.750</p>
<p> Non-EU flour export  2.040	 2.000		1.803</p>
<p> Final stock	    2.021	 2.061		2.212</p>
</text>
